{
  "id": "W003-load-repair-fails",
  "note": "W003：讀檔修復（save.loaded 掛鉤）回傳的變更不合法時，Game.load 丟錯而不是回傳錯誤訊息，而且狀態已經換成存檔的、回退已經清空。",
  "seed": 7,
  "setup": {
    "scenario": "emptyRoom",
    "hook": {
      "name": "save.loaded",
      "returns": [
        {
          "op": "cash",
          "delta": -1
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "commit": [
        {
          "op": "flag",
          "key": "before_save",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "save": true
    },
    {
      "commit": [
        {
          "op": "flag",
          "key": "after_save",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "load": "剛才那一份"
    }
  ],
  "expect": "load 回傳錯誤訊息（或丟錯也行），狀態仍然有 after_save，回退還有 2 步。實際：丟 ChangeError，flags 只剩 before_save，undo.size 是 0。"
}
